rule: 화면·CSV·API 세 경로는 `DataItemSaveCore`/`DataItemChecks` 공용 코드로 검사 1~7을 돈다(따로 구현하지 않는다)
file: src/backend/mdm/lib/src/main/java/com/dongkuk/dmes/mdm/common/segment/DataItemChecks.java
test: cd src/backend && JAVA_HOME=/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home ./gradlew :mdm:api:test --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.common.segment.DataItemChecksSqliteTest" --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.common.segment.MasterDataLedgerJudgmentSqliteTest" --console=plain
e2e: no
--- find
        boolean ok = switch (path) {
            case SCREEN, CSV -> LockedMaruData.MDM.equals(data.sourceKind());
            case API -> LockedMaruData.EXTERNAL.equals(data.sourceKind()) && callerSystem != null
                    && callerSystem.equals(data.sourceSystem());
        };
--- replace
        boolean ok = switch (path) {
            case SCREEN -> LockedMaruData.MDM.equals(data.sourceKind());
            case CSV -> true;
            case API -> LockedMaruData.EXTERNAL.equals(data.sourceKind()) && callerSystem != null
                    && callerSystem.equals(data.sourceSystem());
        };
